    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000syg0](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000syg0) Magnitude 5.2 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on May 18 2026 22km S of Kyauktan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 16.4431 longitude 96.3164. It impacted 4002128 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
